# graphify: keep the graph and the semantic cache, drop everything regenerable.
# graph.html and wiki/ are regenerated from graph.json in seconds
# (`graphify export html` / `export wiki`), and cache/ast/ rebuilds for free.
# cache/semantic*/ IS committed: it is the only expensive artifact here, and
# it is what stops a rebuild re-paying the LLM extraction.
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/wiki/
graphify-out/cache/ast/
graphify-out/.graphify_analysis.json
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
graphify-out/.graphify_semantic_marker
